l).", "reference_indexes": [0]}, {"snippet": "State Variations: While ₹1,000 is the central benchmark, individual states may establish their own compounding amounts or local traffic rules through official state notifications. You can check specific local challan records via the official Parivahan eChallan Portal .", "snippet_links": [{"text": "Parivahan eChallan Portal", "link": "https://echallan.parivahan.gov.in/"}]}], "reference_indexes": [0]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "If you want to check the rules for a specific state (such as Uttar Pradesh, Maharashtra, or Karnataka), let me know and I can share the local compounding details."}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "Riding Without Helmet Fine (State-Wise List) - Spinny", "link": "https://www.spinny.com/blog/riding-without-helmet-fine/", "snippet": "Riding Without Helmet Fine (State-Wise List) ... Driving without using a helmet can result in a fine of ₹1,000 and disqualification for three months from obtaining...", "source": "Spinny", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.spinny.com&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTGyOqS3Uf17M8UPoK4onaUvFbkT_6n_UgG2Ph35aCBOnuCvw0g9qlyLb3EF40l7w4xkzyMwY-E4ZQvNUduubfUdSk8mrQSMTtcy5q0"}]}}}